We have Earl Grey,English Breakfast, Cinnamon Stick...
我們有伯爵茶,英式早餐茶,肉桂茶

3
00:00:08,20 --> 00:00:11,87
...Chamomile,Mint Medley, Blackberry and
菊花茶,薄荷茶,黑莓茶

4
00:00:12,14 --> 00:00:14,80
Wait,there's one more. Lemon Soother!
還有…檸檬派

5
00:00:16,71 --> 00:00:20,01
You're not the guy that asked for tea,are you?
你不是那個要喝茶的人對吧?

6
00:00:22,15 --> 00:00:24,24
The One Where The Monkey Gets Away
六人行 第1季 第19集 猴子被送走

7
00:00:25,26 --> 00:00:31,00
-=BT之家DRM小組 http://bbs.btbbt.com=- 榮譽出品 河馬根據網絡字幕微調製作

8
00:01:12,07 --> 00:01:14,63
Mail call! Rachel Greene,bunk seven.
瑞秋,你有信

9
00:01:14,84 --> 00:01:16,46
Thank you.
謝謝

10
00:01:17,67 --> 00:01:20,94
Oh,cool! A free sample of coffee.
酷,免費試喝的咖啡

11
00:01:21,14 --> 00:01:25,04
Oh,good. Because where else would we get any?
太好了,因為在哪兒還有免費的咖啡?

12
00:01:25,81 --> 00:01:27,58
Oh,right.
哦,是啊

13
00:01:29,15 --> 00:01:31,58
-Oh,great. -What is it?
-太好了 -那是什麼?

14
00:01:31,79 --> 00:01:33,62
Country club newsletter.
鄉村俱樂部的每日公報

15
00:01:33,86 --> 00:01:38,66
My mother sends me the engagement notices for inspiration.
我媽寄來通知有人要訂婚了

16
00:01:39,59 --> 00:01:43,36
Oh,my God! It's Barry and Mindy!
噢,我的天!是巴瑞和明蒂

17
00:01:43,63 --> 00:01:45,46
Barry,who you almost
巴瑞,你幾乎…

18
00:01:45,67 --> 00:01:47,26
And Mindy,your maid of
明蒂,你的伴娘

19
00:01:47,50 --> 00:01:50,03
Let me see. That's Mindy?
我看看,那是明蒂?

20
00:01:50,27 --> 00:01:51,47
She is pretty!
真漂亮!

21
00:01:53,88 --> 00:01:55,04
Lucky...
她真幸運…

22
00:01:56,61 --> 00:02:00,21
...to have had a friend like you.
有你這樣的朋友

23
00:02:01,02 --> 00:02:03,54
Now it's quiet time.
現在是靜默時間

24
00:02:09,16 --> 00:02:12,02
Marcel,bring me the rice. Come on.
馬修,拿飯給我,快…

25
00:02:12,26 --> 00:02:13,99
Good boy. Give me the rice.
好小子.把飯給我

26
00:02:14,26 --> 00:02:15,92
Thank you. Good boy.
真乖,謝謝

27
00:02:16,26 --> 00:02:21,46
He's mastered the difference between "bring me the" and "pee in the."
他終於能分辨「拿來」和「尿在」的差別了

28
00:02:23,97 --> 00:02:26,81
"Bring me the" and Rach?
瑞秋怎麼啦?

29
00:02:28,98 --> 00:02:30,54
Oh,I'm sorry.
抱歉

30
00:02:31,51 --> 00:02:33,17
This is so stupid!
我真是太笨了

31
00:02:33,45 --> 00:02:35,58
I mean,I gave Barry up,right?
是我不要巴瑞的,對吧?

32
00:02:35,78 --> 00:02:37,84
I should be happy for them.
我應該為他們高興

33
00:02:38,05 --> 00:02:39,75
I am. I'm happy for them.
我…真為他們高興

34
00:02:40,39 --> 00:02:42,79
-Really? -No.
-真的? -不

35
00:02:43,46 --> 00:02:46,99
I guess it would be different if I were with somebody.
如果我和別人在一起就不同了

36
00:02:47,20 --> 00:02:48,56
Whoa,what....
誰,什麼…

37
00:02:49,83 --> 00:02:54,03
What happened to "Forget relationships! I'm done with men!"
你不是說要忘了那段感情,不再和男人在一起

38
00:02:54,24 --> 00:02:57,07
The whole penis embargo?
厭惡男人嗎?

39
00:03:01,54 --> 00:03:02,64
I don't know.
我不知道

40
00:03:02,88 --> 00:03:07,08
It's not about no guys. It's about the right guy.
我想這不是沒有男人的問題, 而是合適男人的問題

41
00:03:07,35 --> 00:03:11,51
With Barry it was safe and easy, but there was no heat.
和巴瑞在一起安全自在 但是沒有激情

42
00:03:11,75 --> 00:03:15,12
With Paolo,all there was,was heat.
和保羅在一起就充滿激情

43
00:03:15,32 --> 00:03:19,99
-lt was this raw,animal,sexual -Right. I got it.
-如野獸般原始的性愛 -好了,我懂

44
00:03:20,83 --> 00:03:22,06
I was there.
我看過你們兩個在一起的樣子

45
00:03:23,03 --> 00:03:25,19
Do you think you can have both?
你認為我能兩者同時擁有嗎?

46
00:03:25,40 --> 00:03:30,17
Someone who's your best friend but also can make your toes curl.
找到一個能當知己 又能讓我感受到激情的人?

47
00:03:30,37 --> 00:03:32,46
Yes.
是呀

48
00:03:32,67 --> 00:03:35,20
Yes,I do. I really do.
我也這麼認為.我真的這麼認為

49
00:03:35,78 --> 00:03:37,75
In fact,it's funny.
其實說來好笑

50
00:03:37,95 --> 00:03:40,92
Often,someone you wouldn't think could...
時常你認為

51
00:03:41,55 --> 00:03:43,38
...curl your toes...
無法讓你感受到激情的人

52
00:03:43,59 --> 00:03:45,95
... might just be the one who...
卻是…

53
00:03:47,42 --> 00:03:48,79
...gets interrupted.
被打斷了

54
00:03:49,06 --> 00:03:50,65
How was the movie?
電影如何?

55
00:03:50,86 --> 00:03:52,55
-Wonderful! -So good!
-很不錯 -很不錯

56
00:03:52,76 --> 00:03:55,70
-Suck fest. -Total chick flick.
-遜斃了 -根本是小妞們看的嘛

57
00:03:57,80 --> 00:04:02,43
I'm sorry it wasn't one of those movies with guns and bombs...
真遺憾這不是槍林彈雨

58
00:04:02,64 --> 00:04:04,87
...and buses going really fast!
公車速度奇快的那種電影

59
00:04:07,21 --> 00:04:09,80
I don't need violence in a movie...
暴力並不能吸引我

60
00:04:10,08 --> 00:04:12,74
...as long as there's a little nudity.
只要有裸體鏡頭我就滿足了

61
00:04:13,05 --> 00:04:16,51
-There was nudity. -I meant female nudity.
-那電影也有裸體鏡頭 -我是指女生的裸體鏡頭

62
00:04:16,72 --> 00:04:20,09
I don't need to see Lou Grant frolicking.
我不愛看盧葛蘭的春宮

63
00:04:20,29 --> 00:04:22,22
Hugh! Hugh Grant!
休葛蘭特!

64
00:04:24,29 --> 00:04:26,28
All right,I've got to go.
我得走了

65
00:04:26,49 --> 00:04:27,93
Come on,Marcel.
走吧,馬修,快

66
00:04:28,13 --> 00:04:31,93
We're gonna go take a bath. Yes,we are,aren't we?
我們去洗澡,對不對?對

67
00:04:32,40 --> 00:04:35,43
They're still just friends,right?
他們只是朋友嗎?

68
00:04:38,67 --> 00:04:40,80
And I will see you tomorrow.
明天見

69
00:04:41,08 --> 00:04:44,07
You're gonna spend tomorrow at Aunt Rachel's.
對,你明天要到瑞秋阿姨家

70
00:04:44,28 --> 00:04:47,11
Does Aunt Monica get a say in this?
等等,摩尼卡阿姨能說句話嗎?

71
00:04:47,78 --> 00:04:50,18
Please,Aunt Monica,please?
摩尼卡阿姨請說?

72
00:04:50,42 --> 00:04:53,68
Unclench. You're not even gonna be here.
別緊張了,你不會在這兒的

73
00:04:59,19 --> 00:05:05,10
-I can't believe we're discussing this. -I agree. I'm,like,in disbelief.
-我無法相信我們竟在討論此事 -我同意,我也無法相信

74
00:05:05,67 --> 00:05:09,13
If it was gonna happen, wouldn't it have happened already?
如果你和瑞秋會愛情產生的話? 還會一直拖到現在嗎?

75
00:05:09,50 --> 00:05:13,96
She said she wants a relationship with someone exactly like me.
她說她在尋找像我這樣的人

76
00:05:14,21 --> 00:05:15,47
She said that?
她真的這樣說?

77
00:05:15,71 --> 00:05:19,01
I added the exactly like me" part.
「像我這樣」是我自己加的

78
00:05:19,38 --> 00:05:23,87
But she's looking for someone. And someone will be there tonight.
她說她在尋找某人,而此人今晚就會出現

79
00:05:24,05 --> 00:05:25,38
"Tonight" tonight?
今天晚上?

80
00:05:25,69 --> 00:05:28,45
It's perfect. It'll just be the two of us.
這樣最好不過了,因為只有我們兩個

81
00:05:28,66 --> 00:05:32,29
She spent all day taking care of my monkey.
她整天都在照顧我的猴子

82
00:05:34,23 --> 00:05:38,36
I can't remember the last time a girl took care of my monkey.
我早已忘記哪個女人照顧過我的猴子

83
00:05:42,34 --> 00:05:46,33
Anyway,I figured after work, I'd pick up some wine...
總之下班後我要去買瓶酒…

84
00:05:46,54 --> 00:05:50,24
...go over there and try to woo her.
去向她「示愛」

85
00:05:51,78 --> 00:05:53,34
Know what you should do?
Know what you should do? 知道你該怎麼做嗎?

86
00:05:53,55 --> 00:05:57,85
Take her back to the 1 890s when that phrase was last used.
帶她回到用「示愛」的十九世紀去

87
00:06:01,62 --> 00:06:05,75
If you keep this up,you'll be finished by the weekend.
如果你繼續這樣,我發誓這星期內 你就可以和這個渾蛋結束

88
00:06:06,19 --> 00:06:09,25
The one in the feathered boa is Dr. Francis.
圍羽毛圍巾的是法博土

89
00:06:09,50 --> 00:06:11,83
Now,she used to be a man.
她曾是個男人

90
00:06:12,57 --> 00:06:13,90
Look,there's Raven.
蕾文出現了

91
00:06:14,10 --> 00:06:17,50
We hate her. We're glad she's dying.
我們討厭她,真高興她就快死了

92
00:06:17,84 --> 00:06:20,17
And then What? Marcel!
什麼?馬修!

93
00:06:20,61 --> 00:06:24,54
Are you playing with Monica's shoes? You're not supposed to
想玩摩妮卡的鞋嗎?你不能玩…

94
00:06:26,85 --> 00:06:30,28
Marcel,did you poo in the shoe?
馬修,你在鞋裡大便?

95
00:06:30,49 --> 00:06:33,25
Oh,Marcel! Bad monkey!
天啊,壞猴子

96
00:06:33,72 --> 00:06:36,42
Oh,God!
哦,天哪!

97
00:06:40,63 --> 00:06:42,53
Sorry,Barry.
抱歉,巴瑞

98
00:06:43,03 --> 00:06:45,12
A little engagement gift.
一份小小的訂婚禮物

99
00:06:45,37 --> 00:06:48,30
I'm sure you didn't register for that.
我相信你沒登記

100
00:06:55,94 --> 00:06:58,21
Who died? Who died?
誰死了?誰死了?

101
00:06:58,41 --> 00:07:01,14
Roll him over! Come on,roll him over!
翻過去!好不好,翻過去!

102
00:07:02,18 --> 00:07:06,45
Well,we know it wasn't Dexter, right,Marcel? Because
好吧,我們知道不是崔斯勒, 因為…馬修?…

103
00:07:06,65 --> 00:07:07,64
Marcel?
馬修?

104
00:07:11,73 --> 00:07:14,13
-How could you lose him? -I don't know!
-你怎會把它弄丟了呢? -天曉得

105
00:07:14,30 --> 00:07:17,73
We were watching TV, he pooped in Monica's shoe....
我正在看電視, 它在摩妮卡的鞋內大便

106
00:07:17,93 --> 00:07:20,87
Wait. He pooped in my shoe? Which one?
它在我的鞋裡大便?哪一雙?

107
00:07:21,07 --> 00:07:23,97
I don't know. The left one!
我不知道,左腳

108
00:07:24,17 --> 00:07:25,23
Which ones?
是哪一雙?

109
00:07:25,44 --> 00:07:29,77
Those little clunky Amish things you think go with everything.
搭配什麼都好看的阿米許鞋

110
00:07:33,48 --> 00:07:36,64
Why is the air in here so negative?
為何一片愁雲慘霧?

111
00:07:37,59 --> 00:07:39,31
Rachel lost Marcel.
瑞秋把馬修弄丟了

112
00:07:39,59 --> 00:07:40,58
Oh,no! How?
不會吧,怎麼丟的?

113
00:07:40,76 --> 00:07:42,81
-He pooped in my shoe. -Which one?
-它在我鞋裡大便 -哪只?

114
00:07:43,06 --> 00:07:45,32
The cute black ones I always wear.
我常穿的那只可愛黑鞋

115
00:07:45,63 --> 00:07:47,69
No,which one?
是哪一隻?

116
00:07:47,90 --> 00:07:50,33
The right or left?
左腳還右腳?

117
00:07:50,73 --> 00:07:52,89
Because the left one is lucky.
因為左腳是幸運鞋

118
00:07:53,13 --> 00:07:54,90
Come on! What am I gonna do?
大家快想辦法!我該怎麼辦?

119
00:07:55,07 --> 00:07:58,66
All right. You're a monkey. You're loose in the city.
有了,如果你是隻猴子,迷失在大城市時

120
00:07:58,94 --> 00:08:00,87
Where do you go?
你會去哪兒?

121
00:08:01,24 --> 00:08:05,08
It's his first time out, so he'll do touristy things.
這是它第一次出門, 所以大概和一般遊客一樣

122
00:08:08,15 --> 00:08:11,95
I'll go to Cats. You go to the Russian Tea Room.
我去百老匯找.你去俄羅斯茶坊

123
00:08:12,52 --> 00:08:15,18
Oh,my God! Come on,you guys!
別再鬧了!

124
00:08:15,42 --> 00:08:17,91
He'll be home any minute. He's gonna kill me!
他馬上就會回家,他不會饒過我的

125
00:08:18,13 --> 00:08:22,36
Search the building. Take the first floor. We'll take the rest.
我們從這棟公寓開始找起 你們找一樓和二樓,菲比和我找三樓和四樓

126
00:08:22,60 --> 00:08:23,96
What am I gonna do?
我該怎麼辦?

127
00:08:24,20 --> 00:08:26,67
You stay here and wait by the phone.
你留在家裡等電話

128
00:08:26,87 --> 00:08:30,46
Spray Lysol in my shoe and wait for Ross to kill you.
在我鞋內嘖芳香劑,順便等羅斯回來殺你

129
00:08:30,67 --> 00:08:33,04
Does anybody want to trade?
有人要交換嗎?

130
00:08:40,35 --> 00:08:41,78
What do you want?
幹嘛?

131
00:08:41,98 --> 00:08:45,35
Mr. Heckles,have you seen a monkey?
哈克先生,我們朋友遺失了一隻猴子 你有看見嗎?

132
00:08:45,55 --> 00:08:48,95
I left a Belgian waffle out here. Did you take it?
我放了威化餅在這兒,是不是你拿了?

133
00:08:49,56 --> 00:08:53,49
-Why'd you leave it in the hall? -I wasn't ready for it.
-你怎會放威化餅在走廊? -我還不想吃

134
00:08:54,00 --> 00:08:55,99
Have you seen a monkey?
你有看見猴子嗎?

135
00:08:57,20 --> 00:08:59,00
I saw Regis Philbin once.
我看過「理吉斯菲邦」

136
00:09:00,00 --> 00:09:01,87
Thank you,Mr. Heckles.
謝謝你,哈克先生

137
00:09:02,97 --> 00:09:04,70
You owe me a waffle.
你們欠我威化餅

138
00:09:06,47 --> 00:09:10,00
He's a black capuchin monkey with a white face...
他是一隻白臉的黑卷尾猴

139
00:09:10,24 --> 00:09:15,27
...with Russian dressing and pickles on the side.
加俄國醬外加醃黃瓜

140
00:09:15,52 --> 00:09:16,64
Thanks.
好,謝謝

141
00:09:18,42 --> 00:09:19,82
How did it go today?
今天過得如何?

142
00:09:20,02 --> 00:09:22,92
Oh,great! It went great. Really great.
很好啊!很好啊.真的很不錯

143
00:09:23,16 --> 00:09:24,49
Is that wine?
那是酒嗎?

144
00:09:25,23 --> 00:09:26,75
You want some?
是的,想喝嗎?

145
00:09:26,96 --> 00:09:28,69
Oh,I would love some.
我非常樂意來點

146
00:09:28,93 --> 00:09:31,26
But let's not drink it here.
可是我們別在這兒喝

147
00:09:31,50 --> 00:09:35,20
I'm feeling crazy. You wanna go to Newark?
我感覺有點瘋狂,我們去紐華克好嗎?

148
00:09:39,14 --> 00:09:44,51
Okay,but before we head off to the murder capital of the Northeast...
前往這東北犯罪首府之前…

149
00:09:44,88 --> 00:09:48,01
... I kind of wanted to run something by you.
…我有些話想說

150
00:09:48,28 --> 00:09:50,84
You know how we were talking before...
我們曾談過…

151
00:09:51,05 --> 00:09:53,89
...about relationships,and stuff.
…感情的問題

152
00:09:54,09 --> 00:09:58,49
-Oh,God,Ross,I cannot do this! -Okay,quick and painful.
-羅斯,我受不了了! -你回絕得倒是很快嘛

153
00:10:07,07 --> 00:10:08,19
Oh,God!
哦,上帝啊!

154
00:10:08,57 --> 00:10:11,60
Okay,all right. All right,okay.
好吧,好吧

155
00:10:11,81 --> 00:10:13,83
Please don't hate me.
羅斯,別恨我

156
00:10:14,04 --> 00:10:15,03
What?
到底是什麼?

157
00:10:17,95 --> 00:10:19,78
You know Marcel?
馬修它…

158
00:10:23,28 --> 00:10:26,78
I kind of lost him.
我把它…弄丟了

159
00:10:41,14 --> 00:10:44,33
I can't believe this.
我真不敢相信

160
00:10:44,64 --> 00:10:47,73
All I asked you to do was keep him in here!
我只是麻煩你別讓它跑出去

161
00:10:47,94 --> 00:10:49,10
I know. I'm sorry.
我知道,對不起

162
00:10:49,31 --> 00:10:51,21
It's partially my fault.
不,我該負一半的責任

163
00:10:51,38 --> 00:10:54,18
I shouldn't have had you start with a monkey.
我不該叫你照顧猴子

164
00:10:54,35 --> 00:10:57,34
You should have started with a pencil.
應該叫你照顧鉛筆才對

165
00:10:57,65 --> 00:11:02,45
I'm doing everything I can. Everyone's looking for him and I got
羅斯,我已盡最大的努力 我已叫大家分頭去找

166
00:11:04,83 --> 00:11:06,59
-Who is it? -Animal Control.
-是誰? -動物控制中心

167
00:11:06,86 --> 00:11:11,86
-I've even got Animal Control. -You called Animal Control?
-瞧,我甚至打給動物控制中心 -你打給動物控制中心?

168
00:11:13,73 --> 00:11:16,53
Why? Do you not like them?
怎麼了?你不喜歡他們?

169
00:11:19,01 --> 00:11:23,20
Marcel is an illegal exotic animal.
馬修是非法的外來動物

170
00:11:26,31 --> 00:11:31,41
I'm not allowed to have him. If they find him,they'll take him away.
我是非法飼養.萬一被他們找到他們就會帶走它

171
00:11:31,62 --> 00:11:34,92
Well,now,see, you never ever told us that.
好吧,可是,你從來就沒有告訴大家

172
00:11:35,72 --> 00:11:39,85
Because I never expected you to invite them to the apartment!
沒錯,因為我沒想到你會請他們來

173
00:11:45,17 --> 00:11:46,57
Thanks for coming.
謝謝你來

174
00:11:46,77 --> 00:11:48,93
Somebody called about a monkey?
有人遺失猴子?

175
00:11:49,14 --> 00:11:52,63
You know,that was a complete misunderstanding.
對,這完全是個誤會

176
00:11:52,84 --> 00:11:55,47
We thought we had a monkey, but we didn't.
我以為我們有養猴子, 但是我們沒有

177
00:11:55,64 --> 00:11:57,58
-Turned out it was a hat. -Cat!
-結果是帽子 -貓!

178
00:11:59,81 --> 00:12:02,48
We checked,no one's seen Marcel.
我們查過了,沒人看到馬修

179
00:12:02,68 --> 00:12:07,02
-My uncle Marcel. -ls that who the monkey's named after?
-我叔叔馬修 -那猴子是以你叔叔命名?

180
00:12:07,92 --> 00:12:10,95
Possession of an illegal exotic is punishable...
你知道持有非法外來動物

181
00:12:11,13 --> 00:12:14,65
... by two years in prison and confiscation of the animal.
可判刑兩年並沒收動物?

182
00:12:14,83 --> 00:12:15,82
Oh,my God!
天啊

183
00:12:16,63 --> 00:12:19,96
You'd put that poor little creature in jail?
你要把這可憐的小東西關進監牢?

184
00:12:24,57 --> 00:12:29,77
Remember how we talked about saying things quietly to yourself first?
菲比,你記得如何先對自己小聲說嗎?

185
00:12:29,98 --> 00:12:33,50
Yes,but there isn't always time.
記得,但總不是時候

186
00:12:35,88 --> 00:12:40,65
I'm sure there's some friendly way to reconcile this. Have a seat.
我相信我們能以友善的處理方式,請坐

187
00:12:40,86 --> 00:12:43,32
We haven't met. I'm Monica Geller.
首先,我們還沒自己介紹,我叫摩妮卡

188
00:12:43,66 --> 00:12:46,22
Oh,my God,you are!
天啊,你是莫尼卡

189
00:12:46,49 --> 00:12:48,12
And you're Rachel Greene!
還有,你是瑞秋對嗎?

190
00:12:49,83 --> 00:12:52,46
Luisa Gianetti! Lincoln High?
露莎,林肯高中

191
00:12:52,70 --> 00:12:56,03
I sat behind you guys in homeroom.
我坐在你們後面

192
00:12:56,74 --> 00:12:59,97
Luisa! Oh,my God!
露莎!哦,天哪!

193
00:13:00,17 --> 00:13:02,23
Monica! It's Luisa!
摩妮卡,是露莎

194
00:13:04,88 --> 00:13:06,31
I went there too!
我也去了那裡!

195
00:13:06,51 --> 00:13:08,51
Luisa! From homeroom!
是在後面那個?

196
00:13:10,62 --> 00:13:13,38
You have no idea who I am,do you?
你們根本不知道我是誰對不?

197
00:13:13,59 --> 00:13:15,18
-No. -Not at all.
-不 -一點也不

198
00:13:15,49 --> 00:13:20,12
Well,maybe that's because you spent four years ignoring me.
或許你們那四年,都在當我不存在

199
00:13:20,33 --> 00:13:24,09
Would it have been hard to say, "Morning,Luisa"...
難道說「早安,露莎」

200
00:13:24,30 --> 00:13:26,66
...or "Nice overalls"?
或「好漂亮的連身褲」有那麼困難嗎?

201
00:13:31,21 --> 00:13:32,80
Oh,I'm so sorry!
對不起

202
00:13:33,01 --> 00:13:37,34
It's not so much you. You were fat. You had your own problems.
我不怪你,你當時很胖, 你有自己的煩惱

203
00:13:39,31 --> 00:13:41,51
But you. What a bitch!
可是你實在是個賤貨

204
00:13:43,38 --> 00:13:44,65
What?
什麼?

205
00:13:44,85 --> 00:13:47,29
You know what? Be that as it may...
別計較了

206
00:13:47,49 --> 00:13:51,58
...could you help us with the monkey thing,for old times'sake?
你真認為你能幫我們找猴子? 看在過去的份上?

207
00:13:51,79 --> 00:13:53,76
Go,Bobcats!
幫我們找

208
00:13:54,36 --> 00:13:57,30
I could. But I won't.
我可以,我不

209
00:13:57,50 --> 00:14:00,76
If I find that monkey,he's mine.
如果我找到猴子,它就是我的了

210
00:14:05,91 --> 00:14:07,84
Sorry.
抱歉

211
00:14:11,21 --> 00:14:12,24
Marcel?
馬修?

212
00:14:12,91 --> 00:14:13,97
Marcel?
馬修?

213
00:14:22,52 --> 00:14:24,35
Hi,can I help you?
需要幫忙嗎?

214
00:14:28,53 --> 00:14:32,69
We're having an emergency, and we were looking for something.
我們有急事,我們在找東西

215
00:14:33,90 --> 00:14:36,56
-A monkey. -Yes,have you seen any?
-猴子 -對,你有看見嗎?

216
00:14:36,77 --> 00:14:39,20
No,I haven't seen a monkey.
我沒看見猴子

217
00:14:39,41 --> 00:14:41,37
Can you fix radiators?
你知道如何修理散熱器嗎?

218
00:14:41,58 --> 00:14:44,98
Sure! Did you try turning the knob back the other way?
當然!你試過將轉鈕轉回去嗎?

219
00:14:45,28 --> 00:14:48,18
-Of course! -Oh. Then,no.
-當然! -那之後我就不知道了

220
00:14:52,39 --> 00:14:56,32
-Taste this. Is there too much rum? -Just a second.
-試試這個是不是加太多蘭姆酒了? -等等

221
00:14:56,52 --> 00:14:59,08
-Hope you find your monkey. -No,wait!
-希望你們能找到猴子 -不,等等

222
00:15:00,56 --> 00:15:03,03
We may not know about radiators...
我們對散熱器或許不太懂

223
00:15:03,30 --> 00:15:08,23
... but we do have expertise in the heating and cooling milieu.
我們可是冷暖環境的專家

224
00:15:11,77 --> 00:15:14,17
Aren't we in the middle of something?
我們不是正在忙嗎?

225
00:15:14,34 --> 00:15:18,21
But these women are very hot, and they need our help.
對,她們很熱而且需要幫助

226
00:15:18,95 --> 00:15:21,21
And they're very hot!
而且很火辣

227
00:15:23,45 --> 00:15:24,92
We can't,all right?
我們不行

228
00:15:25,22 --> 00:15:26,58
We're sorry.
抱歉你們不知道

229
00:15:26,82 --> 00:15:30,72
You don't know how sorry. We promised to find this monkey.
我們有多抱歉,我們答應人家要找猴子

230
00:15:30,93 --> 00:15:34,05
He's this high and answers to the name Marcel.
它約這麼高,名叫馬修

231
00:15:34,26 --> 00:15:38,60
So if we could get pictures of you, it'd help us out.
如果能擁有你們的照片,就算是幫了大忙

232
00:15:46,64 --> 00:15:50,37
From now on,you don't get to talk to other people.
從現在起不准你和其他人講話

233
00:15:58,82 --> 00:15:59,95
-Oh,my God! -What?
-噢,我的天! -什麼?

234
00:16:00,15 --> 00:16:03,15
Something brushed up against my right leg.
有東西碰到我的右腳

235
00:16:04,12 --> 00:16:07,18
Oh,it's okay. It was just my left leg.
沒什麼,是我的左腳

236
00:16:08,76 --> 00:16:09,75
Look,Phoebe!
看,菲比

237
00:16:10,50 --> 00:16:12,56
Oh,Marcel! Come here!
馬修,過來…

238
00:16:12,80 --> 00:16:14,32
Step aside,ladies.
站過去,兩位小姐

239
00:16:16,00 --> 00:16:19,10
-What are you gonna do? -Just a tranquilizer.
-你要幹什麼? -打鎮定劑

240
00:16:35,02 --> 00:16:36,85
Run,Marcel,run!
快跑,馬修,快跑!

241
00:16:37,19 --> 00:16:38,18
Damn!
壞了!

242
00:16:38,46 --> 00:16:41,76
-Are you okay? -I think so.
-你還好吧? -還行.哦

243
00:16:50,20 --> 00:16:51,19
Oh,gosh!
哦，糟了!

244
00:17:02,72 --> 00:17:06,55
We've been all over the neighborhood! He's just gone!
我們把周圍的鄰居都找遍了, 它不見了,就這麼消失了

245
00:17:06,75 --> 00:17:09,88
-You don't know that. -It's cold,it's dark.
-羅斯,還不一定 -拜託,天氣好冷天又黑

246
00:17:10,09 --> 00:17:12,35
He doesn't know the Village!
它根本不認識路!

247
00:17:12,56 --> 00:17:17,50
And now I have a broken foot. I have no monkey and a broken foot!
現在我的腳又受傷了, 猴子沒了還換來受傷的腳

248
00:17:17,73 --> 00:17:18,99
Thank you very much!
真的感謝你!

249
00:17:19,20 --> 00:17:22,00
I've said I'm sorry a million times.
羅斯,我已向你道歉過無數次

250
00:17:22,30 --> 00:17:23,93
What do you want me to do?
你到底要我怎麼樣?

251
00:17:24,27 --> 00:17:28,11
You want me to break my foot too? I'll break it right now.
你也要我的腳受傷?要我也把腳弄傷

252
00:17:28,31 --> 00:17:31,77
Oh,my God! There,are you happy now?
瞧,高興了吧

253
00:17:31,98 --> 00:17:35,75
Yeah,now that you kicked the sign...
對,你踢完路標後

254
00:17:35,95 --> 00:17:39,44
... I don't miss Marcel anymore!
我突然不再想念馬修了

255
00:17:40,75 --> 00:17:43,45
It's not like I did this on purpose.
我真的不是故意的

256
00:17:43,66 --> 00:17:45,75
No,this is just vintage Rachel.
當然,這是典型的瑞秋

257
00:17:46,03 --> 00:17:48,79
Things just sort of happen around you!
這種事常發生在你身上

258
00:17:49,00 --> 00:17:52,69
You're off in "Rachel Land," doing your "Rachel Thing"...
你活在自己的世界中 做著自己的事情…

259
00:17:52,90 --> 00:17:57,23
...oblivious to people's monkeys or to people's feelings and
完全無視別人的猴子, 或是別人的感覺…

260
00:17:57,50 --> 00:18:00,60
I don't want to hear it! Forget it,okay?
羅斯,我不想聽!忘了他,好不好?

261
00:18:01,58 --> 00:18:03,67
What?
什麼?

262
00:18:06,28 --> 00:18:08,87
Hey,banana man!
嗨,香蕉男!

263
00:18:14,79 --> 00:18:16,19
This is so intense!
這下可好

264
00:18:16,39 --> 00:18:21,42
One side of my butt is totally asleep and the other side has no idea.
一邊的屁股在睡覺, 另一邊卻毫無所知

265
00:18:24,03 --> 00:18:27,93
-What's with Phoebe? -Tranquilizer dart.
-菲比怎麼啦? -麻醉槍

266
00:18:29,50 --> 00:18:31,80
Hi! Did you order some bananas?
你有訂香蕉嗎?

267
00:18:31,97 --> 00:18:34,46
-What about it? -Give me my monkey back!
-那是幹嗎的? -還我的猴子

268
00:18:34,71 --> 00:18:38,04
-I don't have a monkey. -Then what's with the bananas?
-我沒猴子 -幹嘛買一箱香蕉?

269
00:18:38,25 --> 00:18:40,27
Potassium.
補充鉀

270
00:18:44,12 --> 00:18:45,95
Okay,where is he?
馬修?它在哪兒?

271
00:18:47,59 --> 00:18:49,85
You're wasting your time.
你在浪費時間

272
00:18:51,56 --> 00:18:53,75
What?
什麼?

273
00:19:02,77 --> 00:19:06,73
-What have you done to him? -That's my monkey. That's Patty.
-你對他幹了什麼? -這是我的猴子,它叫佩蒂

274
00:19:08,78 --> 00:19:11,47
Are you insane? Come here,Marcel.
你瘋了不成?過來,馬修…

275
00:19:12,55 --> 00:19:13,71
Come here,Patty.
過來,佩蒂

276
00:19:13,91 --> 00:19:15,40
Come here,Marcel.
過來,馬修…

277
00:19:15,92 --> 00:19:16,97
Come here,Patty.
過來,佩蒂

278
00:19:17,15 --> 00:19:18,98
Here,monkey.
猴子過來…

279
00:19:19,45 --> 00:19:20,51
Here,monkey!
過來,猴子!

280
00:19:20,72 --> 00:19:22,48
Gotcha!
總算逮到你了

281
00:19:23,06 --> 00:19:25,72
-Give me my monkey back! -It's mine.
-把我的猴子還給我 -那是我的猴子

282
00:19:25,93 --> 00:19:27,92
Take this up with the judge.
你們到法官面前去爭吧

283
00:19:28,13 --> 00:19:32,69
That's not my monkey. The dress is mine. Send it back whenever.
那不是我的猴子 只有衣服是我的,隨時可以送回來

284
00:19:32,90 --> 00:19:34,80
All right,I want my monkey!
好吧,我要我的猴子!

285
00:19:35,00 --> 00:19:37,99
-Oh,come on,Luisa. -Sorry,prom queen.
-露莎,拜託 -抱歉了,舞會皇后

286
00:19:38,21 --> 00:19:41,44
You had to be a bitch in school, instead of fat.
你高中時幹嘛那麼賤,為何不當個胖妹?

287
00:19:43,74 --> 00:19:46,11
In high school,I was prom queen...
在學校我是舞會皇后

288
00:19:46,38 --> 00:19:49,98
...and the homecoming queen and you...
返校皇后,但是你

289
00:19:50,18 --> 00:19:52,05
...were also there.
你也在的啊

290
00:19:52,92 --> 00:19:56,91
But this isn't high school. We're all adults here!
但是這不是高中,我們現在都是成年人!

291
00:19:57,22 --> 00:19:59,99
Heckles! Can I have this?
我能要這個嗎?

292
00:20:00,73 --> 00:20:02,32
For the most part.
隨意

293
00:20:02,53 --> 00:20:07,06
If you take this monkey,I'll lose an important person in my life.
如果你把猴子帶走 我將失去我生命中重要的人

294
00:20:07,27 --> 00:20:11,40
You can hate me if you want, but please do not punish him.
你可以恨我,請別折磨他

295
00:20:11,61 --> 00:20:14,80
You have a chance to be the bigger person here.
此時你有機會成為大人物

296
00:20:15,01 --> 00:20:16,84
Take it!
把握機會吧

297
00:20:19,98 --> 00:20:21,00
No.
不

298
00:20:21,72 --> 00:20:26,24
All right. Then I'll call your supervisor and tell her...
那麼,我只好告訴你的長官

299
00:20:26,42 --> 00:20:29,29
...you shot my friend with a dart!
你在我朋友的屁股上開了一槍

300
00:20:36,60 --> 00:20:39,33
It'll be nice to get this off, won't it?
終於能脫去這件衣服,不是嗎?

301
00:20:39,53 --> 00:20:42,50
Or we can leave it on. That's fine.
或是這樣也不錯

302
00:20:42,70 --> 00:20:47,04
With the right pumps, that would be a great little outfit.
配上鞋就是完整的一套

303
00:20:50,61 --> 00:20:54,91
Listen,I'm sorry I was so hard on you before
抱歉,我對你這麼凶

304
00:20:55,12 --> 00:20:58,24
No,it was my fault. I almost lost your
不,這都是我的錯,我差點…

305
00:20:58,45 --> 00:21:02,15
Yeah,but you got him back. You were great.
不,它也是你找回來的,你做得很好

306
00:21:06,59 --> 00:21:10,19
We still have that bottle of wine.
那瓶酒還在

307
00:21:10,43 --> 00:21:14,30
Are you in the mood for something grape?
有心情喝杯葡萄酒嗎?

308
00:21:14,53 --> 00:21:17,77
-Sure,that would be good. -All right.
-好呀 -很好

309
00:21:27,88 --> 00:21:31,04
The neighbors must be vacuuming.
隔壁一定在用吸塵器

310
00:21:37,32 --> 00:21:40,82
Well,as long as we're here...
只要我們在這兒…

311
00:21:42,46 --> 00:21:44,33
...and not on the subject....
…不談那個話題…

312
00:21:45,67 --> 00:21:47,93
I was thinking about...
我在想…

313
00:21:50,27 --> 00:21:53,30
... how mad we got at each other before.
…我們剛剛實在是惡言相向

314
00:21:57,08 --> 00:22:00,44
And maybe it was partially because of how we
大概是因為我們…

315
00:22:01,08 --> 00:22:02,91
-Rachel? -Barry?
-瑞秋? -瑞秋?

316
00:22:03,22 --> 00:22:07,71
I can't do it. I can't marry Mindy.
我辦不到.我無法和明蒂結婚

317
00:22:07,92 --> 00:22:10,45
I think I'm still in love with you.
我想我愛的人依然是你

318
00:22:15,53 --> 00:22:19,40
We have got to start locking that door!
我們得開始鎖門了!

319
00:22:27,44 --> 00:22:28,74
Show us! Come on!
給我們看看!來嗎!

320
00:22:28,94 --> 00:22:32,88
-lt was such a long time ago. -Okay,fine. All right.
-很久很久以前 -好吧

321
00:22:33,08 --> 00:22:37,24
This is me in The Sound of Music. See the von Trapp kids?
這是我在「音樂之聲」裡面, 看見范崔普的孩子嗎?

322
00:22:37,58 --> 00:22:40,35
That's because I'm in front of them.
因為我擋在他們前面

323
00:22:40,62 --> 00:22:42,38
Big nun!
大修女!

324
00:22:43,19 --> 00:22:45,42
I thought that was an alp.
我以為那是阿爾卑斯山

325
00:22:45,59 --> 00:22:47,82
High school wasn't my favorite time.
我的高中時代並不如意

326
00:22:48,03 --> 00:22:50,19
I loved high school.
我愛高中

327
00:22:50,40 --> 00:22:54,20
It was four years of parties, dating and sex and
四年的舞會,約會和做愛

328
00:22:54,40 --> 00:22:57,80
Well,I went to boarding school with 400 boys.
我和400個男孩上的住宿學校

329
00:22:58,07 --> 00:23:02,37
Any sex I had would've involved a major lifestyle choice.
每次做愛都是一次生活方式的重大抉擇

330
00:23:04,21 --> 00:23:07,48
Doesn't it seem like a million years ago?
天啊,那不是回到史前時代?

331
00:23:11,65 --> 00:23:14,68
My butt cheek is waking up!
我的屁股醒了

332
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


333
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


